        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Document Layout Recreation</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            background-color: #d8e3d0;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 40px 20px;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            font-family: 'Kaiti', 'STKaiti', 'KaiTi_GB2312', serif;\n            color: #2c2c2c;\n            line-height: 1.8;\n        }\n\n        .paper {\n            width: 800px;\n            background-color: #fdfbf4;\n            position: relative;\n            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            padding-bottom: 40px;\n        }\n\n        .grid-bg {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background-image: \n                linear-gradient(to right, #f0ebd8 1px, transparent 1px),\n                linear-gradient(to bottom, #f0ebd8 1px, transparent 1px);\n            background-size: 26px 26px;\n            background-position: 0 10px;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n\n        .content-layer {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n\n        .top-bar {\n            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            padding: 8px 30px;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: flex-end;\n            align-items: center;\n            margin: 15px 20px 25px 20px;\n            gap: 20px;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\n        }\n\n        .page-number {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n        }\n\n        .placeholder {\n            background-color: #e6ddb8;\n            border: 1px dashed #c0b898;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            color: #7a7562;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            font-family: sans-serif;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .icon-placeholder {\n            width: 70px;\n            height: 40px;\n            border-radius: 20px 20px 5px 20px;\n        }\n\n        .main-layout {\n            display: flex;\n            padding: 0 30px;\n            gap: 15px;\n        }\n\n        .left-sidebar {\n            width: 180px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .annotation-box {\n            border: 1.5px solid #e2d973;\n            padding: 8px;\n            color: #c92a2a;\n            font-size: 15px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            background-color: rgba(253, 251, 244, 0.9);\n            position: absolute;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n        }\n\n        .box-1 {\n            top: 45px;\n        }\n\n        .box-2 {\n            top: 435px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        .right-content {\n            flex-grow: 1;\n            font-size: 17px;\n            padding-right: 10px;\n        }\n\n        h2 {\n            font-size: 19px;\n            margin-top: 25px;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            display: inline-block;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .highlight {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n\n        .highlight::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 3px;\n            left: -2px;\n            right: -2px;\n            height: 12px;\n            background-color: rgba(235, 222, 115, 0.6);\n            z-index: -1;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        p {\n            margin-top: 0;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            text-indent: 0;\n        }\n\n        .indent {\n            display: inline-block;\n            width: 34px; /* Simulate 2 character indent */\n        }\n\n        .text-red {\n            color: #c92a2a;\n        }\n\n        .underline-red {\n            border-bottom: 1.5px solid #c92a2a;\n            padding-bottom: 1px;\n        }\n\n        .circle-red {\n            border: 1.5px solid #c92a2a;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin: 0 2px;\n            display: inline-block;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"paper\">\n    <div class=\"grid-bg\"></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"content-layer\">\n        <div class=\"top-bar\">\n            <div class=\"page-number\">第七页</div>\n            <div class=\"placeholder icon-placeholder\">[Icon: Lemons]</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"main-layout\">\n            <div class=\"left-sidebar\">\n                <div class=\"annotation-box box-1\">\n                    实现自身价值，做出贡<br>\n                    献，是主观意识的贡<br>\n                    献，而不是为了得到他<br>\n                    人认可而采取的行动。<br>\n                    是主观意识的他人贡<br>\n                    献，我对他人有用。\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"annotation-box box-2\">\n                    “禁炫耀”\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"right-content\">\n                <h2><span class=\"highlight\">从这一刻起，就能变得幸福</span></h2>\n                <p><span class=\"indent\"></span><span class=\"text-red\">对人而言，最大的不幸就是不喜欢自己。</span></p>\n                <p><span class=\"indent\"></span>“幸福即贡献感”</p>\n                <p><span class=\"indent\"></span>无论是用行为标准还是存在标准，都需要“感受”到自己对他人有用，也就是贡献感。</p>\n                <p><span class=\"indent\"></span>“我对共同体有益”“我对他人有用”这种想法足以让人体会到自己的价值。</p>\n                <p><span class=\"indent\"></span>获得贡献感的手段一旦成了“被他人认可”，最终就不得不按照他人的愿望来过自己的人生。通过认可欲求获得的贡献感没有自由。</p>\n                <p><span class=\"indent\"></span>即使不特意去寻求他人认可，也可以体会到“我对他人有用”。（主观感觉）</p>\n\n                <h2><span class=\"highlight\">追求理想者面前的两条路</span></h2>\n                <p><span class=\"indent\"></span><span class=\"circle-red\"><span class=\"underline-red\">优越性追求</span></span>，希望进步和追求理想状态，以希望特别优秀而得到他人的关注，而当执行一些不好的事件时也能得到他人关注，就转变为“希望特别差劲”，<span class=\"circle-red\"><span class=\"underline-red\">属于廉价的优越性追求</span></span></p>\n\n                <h2><span class=\"highlight\">甘于平凡的勇气</span></h2>\n                <p><span class=\"indent\"></span>普通并不等于无能，<span class=\"underline-red\">我们根本没必要特意炫耀自己的优越性。</span></p>\n\n                <h2><span class=\"highlight\">人生是一连串的刹那</span></h2>\n                <p><span class=\"indent\"></span>不要把人生理解成一条线，而是理解成点的连续。</p>\n                <p><span class=\"indent\"></span>人生是连续的刹那，<span class=\"underline-red\">我们只能活在“此时此刻”</span>，我们的人生只存在刹那之中。</p>\n\n                <h2><span class=\"highlight\">舞动人生</span></h2>\n                <p><span class=\"indent\"></span>跨出家门的那一瞬间“旅行”已经开始，朝着目的地出发途中的每一个瞬间都是旅行。如果因某事而未达到目的地，也并非旅行。</p>\n\n                <h2><span class=\"highlight\">最重要的是“此时此刻”</span></h2>\n                <p><span class=\"indent\"></span><span class=\"underline-red\">聚焦“此时此刻”是认真而平淡地做好现在能做的事情。</span></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
